      ],
      "html": "<div class=\"hint\">★筛选口径: 汇总五路当日候选去重 → 共振路数(被几路同时选中)优先 → 路内位置分 → 执行期望 → 取前5; 每行标注来源路与该路核心指标。环境: 温度12.7(冰点) · 涨停40·炸板18·跌停21</div><div class=\"card\"><table style=\"table-layout:fixed;width:100%\"><colgroup><col style=\"width:26px\"><col style=\"width:104px\"><col style=\"width:74px\"><col><col style=\"width:176px\"><col style=\"width:88px\"></colgroup><tr><th>#</th><th>标的</th><th>共振·位置</th><th>来源路核心指标与判据</th><th>执行口径(T+1开买·各路历史值)</th><th>题材/归位</th></tr><tr><td>1</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>博云新材</b><br><span class=\"mut\">002297</span></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>1</b><br><span class=\"mut\">位置分5</span></td><td style=\"word-break:break-word\"><b>②席位</b> #1 综合分4.99·共振1<br><span class=\"mut\">[A]国泰海通证券股份有限公司 净买7387万</span></td><td style=\"word-break:break-word\"><span class=\"mut\">②席位</span> 滚执1 58.1%/1.05%(n=152)</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">—</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>闽东电力</b><br><span class=\"mut\">000993</span></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>1</b><br><span class=\"mut\">位置分5</span></td><td style=\"word-break:break-word\"><b>①竞价</b> #1 竞价分40.1<br><span class=\"mut\">一字·3板 · 首封09:25</span></td><td style=\"word-break:break-word\"><span class=\"mut\">①竞价</span> 高开0~5% +0.39%/57%(n=294)</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">—</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>高斯贝尔</b><br><span class=\"mut\">002848</span></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>1</b><br><span class=\"mut\">位置分5</span></td><td style=\"word-break:break-word\"><b>⑤质量</b> #1 抓龙率15.7%·分6<br><span class=\"mut\">主导: 开板次数:开2次+(+1.9); 换手率:10-20%(+0.4); 首封时间:早盘≤10:00(+0.2)</span></td><td style=\"word-break:break-word\"><span class=\"mut\">⑤质量</span> 执1 43.1%/-0.33% · 执2 44.5%/-0.24%</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">待归位·黑色家电</td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>金健米业</b><br><span class=\"mut\">600127</span></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>1</b><br><span class=\"mut\">位置分4</span></td><td style=\"word-break:break-word\"><b>②席位</b> #2 综合分3.35·共振1<br><span class=\"mut\">[A]国盛证券股份有限公司宁波 净买4081万</span></td><td style=\"word-break:break-word\"><span class=\"mut\">②席位</span> 滚执1 55.7%/1.67%(n=42)</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">—</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>远 望 谷</b><br><span class=\"mut\">002161</span></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>1</b><br><span class=\"mut\">位置分4</span></td><td style=\"word-break:break-word\"><b>①竞价</b> #2 竞价分29.8<br><span class=\"mut\">一字·首板 · 首封09:25</span></td><td style=\"word-break:break-word\"><span class=\"mut\">①竞价</span> 高开0~5% +0.39%/57%(n=294)</td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">—</td></tr></table></div><div class=\"hint\">候选来源: ①竞价 5只 · ②席位 5只 · ③题材 无当日产出 · ④产逻 无当日产出 · ⑤质量 5只；共振≥2: 0只；去重后候选15只</div><div class=\"hint\">本卡为跨路筛选后最值得操作/观察的清单, 非买入指令; 执行口径=各路历史桶均值/滚动值(非个股预言), 缺口径的路如实标 —。</div>",
